DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ggppiiookkeeyyss driver handles events triggered by GPIO keys.  Currently,
     only lid status events are supported.

     The lid status is set up as a sensor and can be monitored using sysctl(8)
     or sensorsd(8).

